00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:49.280 line:100%
Traces of an anesthetic were detected
in the victim's blood.

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:52.400 line:100%
A distinct injection mark on the neck.

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:55.040 line:100%
Multiple signs of struggle on the limbs.

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:57.080 line:100%
The surface of the body
shows a cherry-red color.

00:01:57.160 --> 00:01:58.800 line:100%
That's the typical sign of death
caused by hypothermia.

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:04.120 line:100%
In other words,
Mei got into a fight with someone.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:06.920 line:100%
During the struggle,
he was injected with an anesthetic

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:08.760 line:100%
before being stuffed into the freezer.

00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:11.280 line:100%
Time of death?

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:12.360 line:100%
Around four weeks ago.

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:13.840 line:100%
Four weeks ago?

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.440 line:100%
Only one student
went missing at that time.

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:19.680 line:100%
The other four students
weren't taken by Mei.

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:24.000 line:100%
Could he have had an accomplice?

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:26.560 line:100%
Maybe they argued over something,

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:28.120 line:100%
then the accomplice killed him

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:29.840 line:100%
and kept using the old method
to continue the crimes.

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:38.840 line:20%
JUNE 10TH, 2015, REPORT FILED

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:41.760 line:100%
At this stage of the case,

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:43.880 line:100%
there's a strong chance Mei's accomplice

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:45.680 line:100%
has taken the four children
out of Weiyang.

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:48.880 line:100%
And right now, we still have no new leads.

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:53.120 line:100%
Tomorrow is the last day
of the seven-day deadline.

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:57.720 line:100%
How about we ask Director Zou
for two more days?

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:07.000 line:100%
I made a promise.

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:08.760 line:100%
Don't be discouraged.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:11.080 line:100%
Even if we miss the deadline,

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:12.560 line:100%
I'll take responsibility.

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:15.880 line:100%
You all keep looking for the children.
Don't stop until they're found.

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:28.560 line:100%
If only we had listened to Xiaohe earlier

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:30.400 line:100%
and focused all our manpower
on investigating Yuanlongli,

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:32.920 line:100%
maybe there would be no regrets.

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:48.720 line:100%
There's no sign at all
of Mei's accomplice or the four children.

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:51.520 line:100%
If we keep digging around this place,
does it still mean anything?

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:56.360 line:100%
No. 1316 shows no signs
of anyone living there after Mei died.

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:58.120 line:100%
But the kidnappings kept happening,

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:00.000 line:100%
using the same old method.

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:01.640 line:100%
What does that tell us?

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:07.760 line:100%
Hey, you.

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:09.160 line:100%
What is that?

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:12.960 line:100%
A strategic meeting needs to come up
with a real-time battle plan or something.

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:14.840 line:100%
Go do your thing. Stay out of the way.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:16.759 line:100%
Alright.

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:23.840 line:100%
Where was I?

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:25.880 line:100%
What does that tell us?

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:30.960 line:100%
To snatch children away
from a crowded and exposed place

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:34.800 line:100%
suggests a hidden route.

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:40.160 line:100%
A hidden route?

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.400 line:100%
Captain Qu has turned
this place upside down.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:45.160 line:100%
We're not checking
the internet café today.

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:47.120 line:100%
We're checking the ways out of it.

00:04:48.240 --> 00:04:51.320 line:100%
First, check the B1 route.

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:54.240 line:100%
Second, check the garage exit route.

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:56.640 line:100%
Same method as before. Block both ends.

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:04.400 line:100%
You're not eating your instant noodles?

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:13.640 line:100%
NEW YORK BLOCK

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:17.680 line:100%
NEED GLASSES? FIND US AT OPTICAL
INSTALLMENT PLANS, CREDIT CARDS

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:24.400 line:100%
-Are you a police officer?
-Yes.

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:26.560 line:100%
Last week, I told you
my platform truck was stolen.

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:29.120 line:100%
Can you do something about it?

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:30.760 line:100%
When are you sending someone
to look into it?

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:34.680 line:100%
Mister, we're working on a case.
I'll help you find it once we're done.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:37.320 line:100%
What did the platform truck look like?

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:39.760 line:100%
That kind. Blue in color.

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:58.440 line:100%
Mr. He, I'll do it.

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:00.000 line:100%
What's on it?

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:04.080 line:100%
Are you done? I'm about to suffocate.

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:10.360 line:100%
I get it now. The trafficker
knocked the children out,

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:11.960 line:100%
then used the platform truck
to haul them out.

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:13.880 line:100%
Search both directions.

00:06:13.960 --> 00:06:15.480 line:100%
See if there are any clues.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:16.600 line:100%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN
GARAGE EXIT, NO ENTRY

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:18.000 line:100%
LASER ENGRAVING, CUSTOM GIFTS

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.680 line:100%
There should've been a car outside
waiting to pick them up.

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:21.920 line:100%
It's not likely the person
dragged the platform truck around.

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.720 line:100%
Most likely that's what happened.

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:25.720 line:100%
But there's still
a small chance otherwise.

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:30.480 line:100%
Mr. Ran once told me
that out of 10,000 possibilities,

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:33.080 line:100%
if you miss one, you might miss the truth.

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:36.520 line:100%
Bai, Hui. You two take this side.
I'll check over there.

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:37.520 line:100%
Okay.

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:47.760 line:100%
You can always count on Ran.

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:07.720 line:100%
Captain Ran,

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:09.560 line:100%
a case was transferred over
from Jiangwan Road Police Station.

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:11.720 line:100%
Last night, a woman
was attacked on the street.

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:14.000 line:100%
She was hit in the back of the head
with a blunt object.

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:17.600 line:100%
CRIME SCENE PHOTO

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:19.040 line:100%
There were no witnesses at the scene,

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:20.880 line:100%
and no clues were found either.

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:27.400 line:100%
THIS WOMAN'S NAME IS ZHAO HONGMEI

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:50.680 line:100%
The patient was struck in the head
with a blunt object,

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:52.600 line:100%
causing multiple brain bleeds.

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:56.200 line:100%
Even if she survives,
the aftereffects will be severe.

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:59.400 line:100%
In milder cases, she may be unable
to take care of herself.

00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:01.960 line:100%
In serious cases,
it could result in brain death.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:03.440 line:100%
That's the overall situation.

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.560 line:100%
Alright. Thank you.

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:13.160 line:100%
Sir, does Zhao Hongmei's situation
remind you of anything?

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:19.840 line:100%
Can you tell me
what happened to your head first?

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:21.520 line:100%
Someone's trying to kill me.

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:24.800 line:100%
He wanted to smash my head
in broad daylight.

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:27.160 line:100%
You mean the same method?

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:31.040 line:100%
The attacker who assaulted
Wu Shanlong is the same person?

00:08:34.839 --> 00:08:36.959 line:100%
Zhao Hongmei and Wu Shanlong's
mutual social connections

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:38.920 line:100%
are mainly linked to Hongyun Huihuang.

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:41.080 line:100%
Wu Shanlong is the second-largest
shareholder there.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:42.680 line:100%
Should we go check it out?

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:46.800 line:100%
What is it?

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:49.680 line:100%
A lot of things line up now.

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:52.040 line:100%
Wu Shanlong isn't smart.

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:54.080 line:100%
But Zhao Hongmei is different.

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:58.160 line:100%
The money Zhao Hongmei used
to open Hongyun Huihuang

00:08:58.240 --> 00:08:59.680 line:100%
was invested by Wu Shanlong.

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:00.760 line:100%
So,

00:09:01.360 --> 00:09:05.360 line:100%
it's very likely that she and Wu Shanlong
ganged up to scam Song Qingsong.

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:09.280 line:100%
Do you think it's possible
that Song Qingsong's back?

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:13.680 line:100%
A wanted fugitive would only risk
coming back to the country

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:16.160 line:100%
for a serious reason.

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:18.600 line:100%
Most likely, he came back for revenge.

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:21.800 line:100%
Any clues at the scene
where Zhao Hongmei was attacked?

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:25.600 line:100%
I checked the photos taken by the station.
Nothing turned up.

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:34.240 line:100%
No clues from Zhao Hongmei's side,

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:36.000 line:100%
but there's something
on Wu Shanlong's end.

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:38.560 line:100%
Wu Shanlong?

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:42.120 line:20%
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY BUREAU
NANSHAN BRANCH WEINAN POLICE STATION

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:47.440 line:100%
Officer Ran. Careful, it's hot.

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:48.720 line:100%
Thank you.

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:51.280 line:100%
-You don't have to do that.
-Officer He, have some tea.

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:56.600 line:100%
Officer He, it's been a while.

00:09:56.680 --> 00:09:57.640 line:100%
You've put on some weight.

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:58.720 line:100%
JUSTICE FOR UNPAID WAGES
DUTIFUL AND RIGHTEOUS

00:09:58.800 --> 00:09:59.680 line:100%
Happy weight.

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:02.600 line:100%
Officer He, Officer Ran.

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:05.280 line:100%
This is the evidence Wu Shanlong
brought in when he filed the report.

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.200 line:100%
PROPERTY OF EVIDENCE

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:23.280 line:100%
WEIYANG BUS STATION

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:25.400 line:20%
WEIYANG BUS GROUP

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:39.480 line:100%
Never seen it. We don't
have wrenches like that here.

00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:40.920 line:100%
SKILLED AND TRUE, FAST AND FAIR

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:45.040 line:100%
Thank you.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.000 line:100%
Excuse me.

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:54.520 line:100%
Please take a look.

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:56.160 line:100%
Have you seen a wrench like this before?

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.320 line:100%
WEIYANG BUS STATION

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:06.920 line:100%
Isn't this the tool
the unit used to issue to everyone

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:08.560 line:100%
when we first started working?

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:11.920 line:100%
You're right.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:14.400 line:100%
A couple of years ago,
the fleet was merged into the company.

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:16.400 line:100%
That whole batch of tools
was phased out at once.

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:18.480 line:100%
Where did they end up?

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:21.840 line:100%
RECYCLE

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:26.160 line:100%
Excuse me. Is your boss in?

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:28.240 line:100%
-Inside.
-Thank you.

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:33.400 line:100%
This should be the place.

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:38.520 line:100%
Excuse me, sir.
I need to ask you something.

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:41.920 line:100%
Have you seen this wrench before?

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:43.800 line:100%
No.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:51.120 line:100%
-Have you seen this person?
-No.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:57.560 line:100%
POLICE RAN FANGXU

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.480 line:100%
I'm a law-abiding citizen.

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:03.400 line:100%
Everything I do is above board.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:11.160 line:100%
Above board, eh?

00:12:12.200 --> 00:12:14.480 line:100%
Above board.

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:32.640 line:100%
Above board.

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:35.320 line:100%
IRON CASTING

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:38.360 line:100%
Officer, I honestly
have no idea about this.

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:40.920 line:100%
It must've been one of my workers
who bought it without thinking.

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:43.120 line:100%
I'll contact the city management team
right away and return it to the owner.

00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:48.120 line:100%
Do you recognize this man now?

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:51.200 line:100%
Looks a bit like the one
from the cement factory.

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:52.760 line:100%
Song Qingsong.

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:56.240 line:100%
But too many people come and go here.

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:58.720 line:100%
After all this time,
I really can't remember.

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:01.440 line:100%
Over here!

00:13:01.520 --> 00:13:02.600 line:100%
Sir!

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:04.960 line:100%
Sir!

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:06.600 line:100%
Help!

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:09.120 line:100%
Ran! What happened?

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:10.880 line:100%
Pull me up!

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:13.360 line:100%
Ran, what were you doing up there?

00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:16.560 line:100%
-What happened?
-Sir!

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:17.760 line:100%
Pull me up!

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:18.960 line:100%
How did this happen?

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:24.320 line:100%
-Why did you climb up here?
-I got stuck.

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:26.680 line:100%
That's dangerous.

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:29.200 line:100%
I got stuck right here.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:36.240 line:100%
Are you alright?

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:39.840 line:100%
What are you holding?

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:43.360 line:100%
Here.

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:45.600 line:100%
-What is this?
-Look here.

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:49.360 line:100%
QINGSONG CEMENT

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:27.800 line:100%
What's wrong?

00:14:28.480 --> 00:14:30.120 line:100%
Missing Ran?

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:36.880 line:100%
There are so many people in the force,

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:39.160 line:100%
but he's still the one
everyone respects most.

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:44.600 line:100%
If he were here, this case
would've been solved by now.

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:51.560 line:100%
He's not all-knowing.

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:56.280 line:100%
He made mistakes on his first case too
and failed as well.

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:01.840 line:100%
Hopefully, my first case…

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:05.200 line:100%
<i>Mr. He, we found a syringe</i>
<i>by the roadside.</i>

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:26.160 line:100%
Han Zi'ang had two needle marks
on his arm.

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:31.040 line:100%
Could it be he was drugged
in the internet café and dragged out,

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:32.800 line:100%
then woke up from the bumps
while on the platform truck?

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:34.840 line:100%
So the trafficker gave him another shot.

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:37.280 line:100%
But he kept struggling,

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:39.680 line:100%
and the syringe
got knocked loose and fell here.

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:42.200 line:100%
The trafficker was afraid
he would cry for help,

00:15:42.280 --> 00:15:43.440 line:100%
so they knocked him out.

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:45.480 line:100%
That's how Han Zi'ang
got the injury on his head.

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:49.200 line:100%
But Han Zi'ang was found
inside New York Block.

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:50.400 line:100%
How do we explain that?

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.680 line:100%
Why would the trafficker
use a platform truck

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:55.360 line:100%
to drag him that far?

00:15:57.560 --> 00:16:00.960 line:100%
Because the underground garage has stairs
leading to B1 of New York Block.

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:02.280 line:100%
The platform truck couldn't go up.

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:18.240 line:100%
This road goes straight
to the main gate of Yuanlongli.

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:21.720 line:100%
Han Zi'ang was brought back
into Yuanlongli.

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:29.520 line:100%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.920 line:100%
No need to ask.
Those cameras broke long ago.

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:17.000 line:100%
On the day Han Zi'ang injured a man,

00:17:17.600 --> 00:17:19.159 line:100%
no one pulling a platform truck was seen.

00:17:21.919 --> 00:17:23.159 line:100%
Check the day before.

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:34.840 line:100%
Hold on.

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:37.880 line:100%
This person is a resident here.

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:40.080 line:100%
Wearing a cap.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.160 line:100%
Can't see the face clearly.

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:54.600 line:100%
Mister.

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:55.520 line:100%
POLICE

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:57.680 line:100%
Your wound is serious.
Come with me and get it treated, alright?

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:00.240 line:100%
Can you hear me?

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:01.800 line:100%
Mister?

00:19:41.720 --> 00:19:42.800 line:100%
Wait.

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:47.720 line:100%
The layout for No. 16
should have another room.

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.520 line:100%
Careful!

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:21.080 line:100%
They're a bit triggered right now.

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:27.120 line:100%
Hush.

00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:32.960 line:100%
Ponies,

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:34.800 line:100%
Dad is home.

00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:54.560 line:20%
POLICE

00:20:56.680 --> 00:20:57.600 line:100%
How are things?

00:20:57.680 --> 00:20:58.920 line:100%
Initial diagnosis says they're fine.

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:00.160 line:100%
We'll take them to the hospital now.

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:01.360 line:100%
Alright.

00:21:04.440 --> 00:21:05.280 line:100%
Get him in the car.

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:10.840 line:100%
Captain Qu.

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:12.480 line:100%
-Captain Qu.
-Bai, Hui.

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:15.040 line:100%
You two did a great job.

00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:16.480 line:100%
No.

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:18.240 line:100%
-We were just backing them up.
-Right.

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:21.160 line:100%
The credit should go to Mr. He, Xiaohe
and Zhong who were guiding us.

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:23.680 line:100%
The real credit goes to you young people.

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:27.680 line:100%
Old folks shouldn't be stuck in old ways.

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:29.680 line:100%
We should trust the younger generation

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:32.000 line:100%
and give them a chance to shine.

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:35.200 line:100%
Back then, Ran was just a fresh graduate.

00:21:35.280 --> 00:21:38.280 line:100%
As his mentor, I gave him
full trust and support.

00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:39.840 line:100%
You've got that backward, haven't you?

00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:42.000 line:100%
Who was supporting whom?

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:43.280 line:100%
Qu Dahai,

00:21:43.920 --> 00:21:46.720 line:100%
forget everyone else, just between us two,

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:50.400 line:100%
who's better at cracking big cases
is pretty obvious, right?

00:21:51.800 --> 00:21:53.800 line:100%
Isn't everything you know
learned from Captain Ran?

00:21:55.880 --> 00:21:57.400 line:100%
Come on. I'm treating you all
to some good food.

00:21:57.480 --> 00:21:59.440 line:100%
-Alright.
-Thank you, Mr. He.

00:22:44.240 --> 00:22:48.000 line:100%
CAROUSEL'S DEAD HEAT

00:23:51.680 --> 00:23:52.720 line:100%
<i>Keyboard,</i>

00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:57.840 line:100%
<i>you're surely going to become</i>
<i>the best keyboard player.</i>

00:24:23.840 --> 00:24:24.960 line:100%
Peng Dachuang.

00:24:25.560 --> 00:24:27.040 line:100%
The facts are clear,

00:24:28.000 --> 00:24:30.040 line:100%
and the chain of evidence
is complete. I advise you…

00:24:30.120 --> 00:24:31.760 line:100%
Can I have a cigarette?

00:24:45.720 --> 00:24:49.600 line:100%
-I advise you…
-You attacked police officers.

00:24:49.680 --> 00:24:51.720 line:100%
-That adds another charge.
-Behave yourself.

00:24:56.040 --> 00:24:56.920 line:100%
Are you alright?

00:25:02.320 --> 00:25:03.360 line:100%
Captain Qu.

00:25:07.520 --> 00:25:08.920 line:100%
Get your wound treated.

00:25:10.720 --> 00:25:12.440 line:100%
-What is it?
-Captain Qu,

00:25:12.520 --> 00:25:13.720 line:100%
can I try?

00:25:15.480 --> 00:25:16.320 line:100%
Have you interrogated a suspect before?

00:25:18.280 --> 00:25:19.600 line:100%
No.

00:25:19.680 --> 00:25:22.120 line:100%
But I'm good friends
with Peng Dachuang's son.

00:25:30.040 --> 00:25:31.360 line:100%
You have half an hour.

00:25:36.520 --> 00:25:37.760 line:100%
We'll be waiting next door.

00:25:37.840 --> 00:25:39.440 line:100%
If anything happens, wave to us.

00:25:40.280 --> 00:25:41.120 line:100%
Okay.

00:25:53.960 --> 00:25:55.160 line:100%
-Get lost!
-I'm here.

00:25:55.240 --> 00:25:56.320 line:100%
I'm here.

00:25:57.520 --> 00:25:58.760 line:100%
Why are you so slow with homework?

00:25:58.840 --> 00:26:00.280 line:100%
We already came up with hundreds of names.

00:26:00.360 --> 00:26:02.880 line:100%
I thought of one.
Let's call it Carousel Band.

00:26:02.960 --> 00:26:04.120 line:100%
Isn't it cool?

00:26:04.880 --> 00:26:06.760 line:100%
Are you advertising your dad's bar?

00:26:06.840 --> 00:26:10.680 line:100%
Everyone knows your dad's bar
is called Carousel's Dead Heat.

00:26:10.760 --> 00:26:13.440 line:100%
Then do you know
why my dad's bar is called Carousel?

00:26:14.480 --> 00:26:17.000 line:100%
Because my nickname is Pony.

00:26:17.080 --> 00:26:20.280 line:100%
My dad named the bar that
because he knew I loved carousels.

00:26:20.360 --> 00:26:23.000 line:100%
I don't believe it. He's so harsh on you.

00:26:23.080 --> 00:26:24.280 line:100%
Pony?

00:26:25.120 --> 00:26:26.400 line:100%
Pony?

00:26:26.480 --> 00:26:27.680 line:100%
Pony…

00:27:11.360 --> 00:27:14.800 line:100%
Peng Dachuang, why did you kidnap
those children?

00:27:24.240 --> 00:27:25.360 line:100%
<i>Was it because of…</i>

00:27:26.240 --> 00:27:27.080 line:100%
Pony?

00:27:27.840 --> 00:27:28.960 line:100%
CAROUSEL'S DEAD HEAT

00:27:57.880 --> 00:27:59.320 line:100%
Pony…

00:28:01.200 --> 00:28:03.000 line:100%
Pony…

00:28:06.720 --> 00:28:08.840 line:100%
My Pony…

00:28:09.760 --> 00:28:12.280 line:100%
Pony…

00:28:14.920 --> 00:28:17.320 line:100%
The ambulance is here! Make way! Hurry!

00:28:17.400 --> 00:28:18.720 line:100%
What happened?

00:28:18.800 --> 00:28:20.160 line:100%
What happened here?

00:28:21.440 --> 00:28:23.560 line:100%
-Sir, step back.
-Back up a little.

00:28:23.640 --> 00:28:26.000 line:100%
-Sir. Sir.
-Sir.

00:28:26.080 --> 00:28:28.480 line:100%
Get lost!

00:28:28.560 --> 00:28:30.440 line:100%
Get lost!

00:28:31.960 --> 00:28:34.920 line:100%
Pony…

00:28:36.400 --> 00:28:37.520 line:100%
Mr. Peng,

00:28:38.600 --> 00:28:41.600 line:100%
the girl next to Pony in this photo is me.

00:28:44.000 --> 00:28:46.280 line:100%
Pony was my best friend.

00:28:46.360 --> 00:28:48.880 line:100%
I understand your pain.

00:28:48.960 --> 00:28:51.040 line:100%
I'm sorry that he died.

00:28:51.120 --> 00:28:53.520 line:100%
Who told you he's dead?
Who told you he's dead?

00:28:53.600 --> 00:28:55.480 line:100%
I see him every day.

00:28:55.560 --> 00:28:57.280 line:100%
I see him every day.

00:28:57.360 --> 00:29:01.160 line:100%
-Dad, I'm hiding now.
-I'm coming to catch you.

00:29:05.240 --> 00:29:06.320 line:100%
Pony,

00:29:06.400 --> 00:29:08.160 line:100%
-found you.
-Dad!

00:29:08.240 --> 00:29:09.480 line:100%
What are you doing?

00:29:13.720 --> 00:29:16.600 line:100%
Those ponies are naughty.
They never want to come home.

00:29:30.480 --> 00:29:33.720 line:100%
Later… Later, they told me

00:29:33.800 --> 00:29:36.440 line:100%
Yuanlongli was going to be demolished
and told me to move out.

00:29:45.800 --> 00:29:46.760 line:100%
DEMOLITION

00:29:47.840 --> 00:29:49.320 line:100%
<i>If I moved away,</i>

00:29:50.440 --> 00:29:51.960 line:100%
<i>how would Pony find his way home?</i>

00:30:32.760 --> 00:30:33.880 line:100%
Who are you looking for?

00:30:37.480 --> 00:30:39.320 line:100%
Is someone in your house beating a child?

00:30:39.920 --> 00:30:41.000 line:100%
There's no child in my house.

00:30:45.320 --> 00:30:46.240 line:100%
What are you up to?

00:30:47.000 --> 00:30:48.000 line:100%
It's in your house.

00:30:50.200 --> 00:30:52.280 line:100%
Are you insane?

00:30:54.640 --> 00:30:56.040 line:100%
Get out of here.

00:30:56.640 --> 00:30:58.600 line:100%
I'm calling the police. Leave now.

00:31:05.640 --> 00:31:07.040 line:100%
Move aside!

00:31:14.080 --> 00:31:17.080 line:100%
Please. Please. Please.

00:31:17.160 --> 00:31:18.360 line:100%
It's not what you think.

00:31:18.440 --> 00:31:20.160 line:100%
I'll send him home right now.

00:31:20.240 --> 00:31:21.880 line:100%
As if I'd believe you.

00:31:21.960 --> 00:31:23.360 line:100%
You're a trafficker.

00:31:23.440 --> 00:31:24.680 line:100%
Weren't you going to call the police?

00:31:24.760 --> 00:31:26.600 line:100%
Fine. I'll call right now.

00:31:26.680 --> 00:31:28.200 line:100%
Please. Don't call the police.

00:31:28.280 --> 00:31:29.040 line:100%
-Get off.
-Don't call the police.

00:31:32.240 --> 00:31:33.640 line:100%
Boy, don't be scared.

00:31:33.720 --> 00:31:34.680 line:100%
I'll get you out of here.

00:31:35.360 --> 00:31:38.040 line:100%
Don't be scared.
I'll take you home right now.

00:31:40.600 --> 00:31:42.000 line:100%
Don't be scared.

00:32:07.840 --> 00:32:10.240 line:100%
Help! Help!

00:32:10.320 --> 00:32:11.880 line:100%
Help!

00:32:12.480 --> 00:32:14.360 line:100%
Help… Help…

00:32:55.960 --> 00:32:57.080 line:100%
Hang in there.

00:32:58.240 --> 00:32:59.440 line:100%
I know it hurts.

00:32:59.520 --> 00:33:00.600 line:100%
Hang in there.

00:33:04.560 --> 00:33:07.120 line:100%
Come. Let me untie the rope for you.

00:33:11.920 --> 00:33:13.200 line:100%
Does it hurt?

00:33:15.520 --> 00:33:16.880 line:100%
Human traffickers deserve to die.

00:33:16.960 --> 00:33:17.800 line:100%
They deserve to die.

00:33:17.880 --> 00:33:20.000 line:100%
They all deserve to die.
They all deserve to die.

00:33:20.080 --> 00:33:23.800 line:100%
Why did that boy
go to your house afterward?

00:33:35.560 --> 00:33:37.480 line:100%
Pony told me

00:33:38.560 --> 00:33:41.000 line:100%
his parents fought every day.

00:33:42.280 --> 00:33:43.600 line:100%
He didn't want to go home.

00:33:45.000 --> 00:33:47.840 line:20%
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY, WEIYANG CITY

00:34:05.000 --> 00:34:07.240 line:100%
CEMENT FACTORY
PAY UP, DEBT MUST BE PAID

00:34:07.320 --> 00:34:08.280 line:100%
Do you have a saw in your car?

00:34:18.160 --> 00:34:24.439 line:100%
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY, WEIYANG CITY

00:34:25.920 --> 00:34:27.039 line:100%
Can you do this?

00:34:27.120 --> 00:34:29.840 line:100%
-If not, come down.
-I'm fine.

00:34:31.680 --> 00:34:33.280 line:100%
Sir. Over here.

00:34:34.999 --> 00:34:36.360 line:100%
What's going on?

00:34:37.439 --> 00:34:38.760 line:100%
I can't free up a hand.

00:34:43.200 --> 00:34:44.439 line:100%
Hold the bag for me.

00:34:53.280 --> 00:34:54.320 line:100%
Let's split up and search.

00:34:54.400 --> 00:34:56.039 line:100%
-You go that side. I'll go this side.
-Alright.

00:36:00.160 --> 00:36:01.000 line:100%
How is it?

00:36:02.160 --> 00:36:04.040 line:100%
-Nothing on my side.
-Same here.

00:36:06.120 --> 00:36:07.520 line:100%
Let's check over there.

00:36:09.680 --> 00:36:10.880 line:100%
Wait.

00:36:15.520 --> 00:36:18.120 line:100%
QINGSONG CEMENT

00:36:18.200 --> 00:36:19.920 line:100%
Why is smoke coming from up there?

00:36:22.640 --> 00:36:23.640 line:100%
Let's go check it out.

00:36:25.120 --> 00:36:26.360 line:100%
Careful, sir.

00:36:27.920 --> 00:36:29.600 line:100%
Slow down.

00:36:30.960 --> 00:36:32.720 line:100%
-Sir.
-It's pitch black.

00:36:32.800 --> 00:36:35.560 line:100%
Climbing stairs is good
for your three highs.

00:36:35.640 --> 00:36:36.800 line:100%
As if.

00:36:37.360 --> 00:36:38.720 line:100%
Slow down.

00:36:40.520 --> 00:36:42.680 line:100%
Climbing stairs helps lose belly fat.

00:36:43.200 --> 00:36:45.120 line:100%
I have no belly fat.

00:36:45.200 --> 00:36:47.560 line:100%
When I was young,
my waist was slimmer than yours.

00:37:05.920 --> 00:37:07.560 line:100%
Sir.

00:37:31.600 --> 00:37:32.640 line:100%
Song Qingsong.

00:37:36.200 --> 00:37:37.720 line:100%
Long time no see, officers.

00:37:39.040 --> 00:37:41.120 line:100%
Why are you back in Weiyang?

00:37:49.320 --> 00:37:51.480 line:100%
Have a seat. Let's sit and talk.

00:37:53.800 --> 00:37:56.000 line:100%
I haven't met anyone since I've been here.

00:38:00.040 --> 00:38:02.040 line:100%
You want to ask about
Xu Meng and her father, right?

00:38:02.120 --> 00:38:04.360 line:100%
And Wu Shanlong and Zhao Hongmei.

00:38:06.520 --> 00:38:07.480 line:100%
Let's do it one by one.

00:38:09.000 --> 00:38:11.240 line:100%
About that young woman
at the foot massage shop,

00:38:11.840 --> 00:38:13.960 line:100%
it's true I paid Wu Shanlong
to get rid of her.

00:38:16.320 --> 00:38:18.080 line:100%
Back then, Wu Shanlong told me

00:38:18.160 --> 00:38:20.960 line:100%
Cripple Du had someone
snatch the body away.

00:38:22.160 --> 00:38:26.240 line:100%
That scoundrel knew
Cripple Du and me were enemies.

00:38:26.840 --> 00:38:28.440 line:100%
But the world is small.

00:38:28.960 --> 00:38:31.120 line:100%
I ran into him when I was overseas.

00:38:32.000 --> 00:38:33.720 line:100%
He had fled too.

00:38:37.160 --> 00:38:39.240 line:100%
Where is Xu Meng's body?

00:38:41.080 --> 00:38:43.640 line:100%
Wu Shanlong was a coward.

00:38:44.240 --> 00:38:46.360 line:100%
He took photos.
He definitely destroyed them.

00:38:47.520 --> 00:38:49.880 line:100%
Why did you go after Zhao Hongmei?

00:38:51.360 --> 00:38:52.800 line:100%
That wretched woman

00:38:52.880 --> 00:38:55.480 line:100%
ganged up with Wu Shanlong
and swindled me out of my money.

00:38:55.560 --> 00:38:58.520 line:100%
I worked half my life
to build that factory.

00:38:58.600 --> 00:39:00.160 line:100%
The pair of them ruined it.

00:39:00.240 --> 00:39:02.240 line:100%
On top of that, they owed
the workers a lot of money.

00:39:02.320 --> 00:39:04.520 line:100%
Those who had followed me
for over 20 years

00:39:04.600 --> 00:39:06.760 line:100%
couldn't even afford medical treatment.

00:39:09.560 --> 00:39:11.800 line:100%
That's why you assaulted Wu Shanlong too?

00:39:12.880 --> 00:39:14.520 line:100%
What I regret most is going soft

00:39:16.800 --> 00:39:18.920 line:100%
and not killing him.

00:39:46.800 --> 00:39:47.840 line:100%
Song,

00:39:49.600 --> 00:39:51.720 line:100%
life hasn't been easy for you
these past years, has it?

00:39:56.440 --> 00:39:58.280 line:100%
When I first ran off,

00:39:59.160 --> 00:40:02.440 line:100%
I thought about bringing
my wife and child over.

00:40:02.960 --> 00:40:04.760 line:100%
But I couldn't reach them at all.

00:40:05.520 --> 00:40:07.040 line:100%
Later, I found out

00:40:07.560 --> 00:40:11.360 line:100%
that woman had already sold the house
and run off with my child.

00:40:18.960 --> 00:40:20.440 line:100%
The money I took with me

00:40:21.600 --> 00:40:23.160 line:100%
was gone in less than two years.

00:40:24.440 --> 00:40:27.240 line:100%
I couldn't speak their language,
and I was undocumented.

00:40:28.120 --> 00:40:30.240 line:100%
I could only do construction work
and make very little money.

00:40:33.080 --> 00:40:34.680 line:100%
You would never guess it.

00:40:35.200 --> 00:40:36.200 line:100%
In the end,

00:40:36.960 --> 00:40:39.080 line:100%
it was Cripple Du who gave me money,

00:40:39.600 --> 00:40:41.920 line:100%
so I could sneak back here
and get my revenge.

00:40:48.200 --> 00:40:51.800 line:100%
We had been enemies half our lives,
but he actually gave me money.

00:40:54.680 --> 00:40:55.920 line:100%
As for what I owed the workers,

00:40:56.880 --> 00:40:59.560 line:100%
I sold components from the factory
to pay them back.

00:41:00.400 --> 00:41:03.040 line:100%
Now my revenge is done.
I don't care about anything anymore.

00:41:04.200 --> 00:41:07.280 line:100%
I admit everything I did.

00:41:08.720 --> 00:41:09.760 line:100%
Come on.

00:41:21.800 --> 00:41:22.720 line:100%
We'll do that after we go downstairs.

00:41:25.000 --> 00:41:26.400 line:100%
Give me a moment to tidy up.

00:41:49.160 --> 00:41:50.160 line:100%
Thank you.